stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE: seat seeded for event
    AVAILABLE --> HELD: hold succeeds (atomic UPDATE)
    HELD --> SOLD: confirm (payment approved)
    HELD --> AVAILABLE: release (cancel) or hold expiry sweep
    SOLD --> [*]

    note right of SOLD
        A SOLD seat is never
        released by expiry or
        by release (BR2).
    end note
